        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert G. Knight, Joan Finney\n- Places: Wichita, Kansas\n- Roles: Mayor of Wichita, Kansas Secretary of Commerce and Housing, Governor of Kansas\n\nFacts:\n- Robert G. \"Bob\" Knight was born on July 31, 1941.\n- Joan Finney was born on February 12, 1925, and she died on July 28, 2001.\n- Joan Finney served as the 42nd Governor of Kansas from 1991 to 1995.\n- Robert G. Knight was the Republican mayor of Wichita, Kansas, for seven terms.\n- Robert G. Knight served under Democratic Governor Joan Finney as Kansas Secretary of Commerce and Housing.",
